WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 29=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.700 --> 01:46.580
(Glorify the Family Name)

01:51.790 --> 01:53.760
Mother only said that
to comfort Madam Wu.

01:53.760 --> 01:55.040
She didn't mean any of it.

01:55.280 --> 01:56.480
Don't take it to heart.

01:57.150 --> 01:57.950
All right.

02:00.360 --> 02:01.784
You're being awfully agreeable.

02:01.800 --> 02:03.704
Is it because
we're visiting your family today?

02:10.030 --> 02:11.470
I cannot stay by my parents' side

02:11.528 --> 02:12.680
and fulfill my duty to them.

02:13.430 --> 02:15.470
I don't want them
worrying about me anymore.

02:17.280 --> 02:18.960
No matter how things are for me here,

02:19.870 --> 02:21.150
in front of my parents,

02:21.630 --> 02:22.840
I'll always say I'm doing well.

02:23.560 --> 02:25.310
I hope you'll help me
keep up appearances.

02:26.590 --> 02:28.080
And I'll return the favor

02:28.136 --> 02:29.430
by respecting your parents

02:29.976 --> 02:31.840
and never putting you
in a difficult position.

02:35.680 --> 02:36.400
Don't worry.

02:40.590 --> 02:42.430
I won't disappoint your parents.

02:56.280 --> 02:57.120
Actually,

02:57.192 --> 02:59.624
if you really want to
put your parents' minds at ease,

03:00.080 --> 03:01.590
come to the capital with me.

03:01.960 --> 03:03.800
Then you'll be the madam
of the household.

03:04.080 --> 03:05.240
How you live your life

03:05.910 --> 03:07.280
will be entirely up to you.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.360
You should go on your own.

03:09.470 --> 03:10.710
I'll stay in Jinling

03:11.150 --> 03:13.120
and fulfill your filial duties
in your stead.

03:16.660 --> 03:21.580
(Glorify the Family Name)

03:28.870 --> 03:30.560
Are you cold, Young Master?

03:31.800 --> 03:32.590
No.

03:37.870 --> 03:38.870
Bring me the cloak.

03:39.630 --> 03:40.400
No need.

03:40.552 --> 03:43.064
Those of us trained in martial arts
aren't afraid of the cold.

03:56.630 --> 03:57.630
Now that you mention it,

03:58.280 --> 03:59.630
I am feeling a little cold.

04:05.360 --> 04:06.560
If Mother sees

04:06.560 --> 04:08.400
me wearing the cloak she made

04:08.590 --> 04:09.870
when we visit her together,

04:10.150 --> 04:12.190
she must think we newlyweds

04:12.430 --> 04:14.030
are very happy together.

04:52.560 --> 04:54.750
We're hardly a young
newlywed couple at our age.

04:57.000 --> 04:58.310
How can you even say that?

05:14.232 --> 05:15.304
What are you laughing at?

05:16.390 --> 05:16.830
Move.

05:32.680 --> 05:34.600
I pay my respects to you, Mother.

05:40.870 --> 05:41.560
Come inside.

05:41.768 --> 05:42.830
Come in and sit down.

05:50.510 --> 05:51.750
You're here. Come.

05:51.750 --> 05:52.390
Mother.

05:53.000 --> 05:53.600
Come.

05:54.920 --> 05:56.310
Here, first,

05:56.920 --> 05:58.040
have some hot tea.

06:01.190 --> 06:02.240
Warm yourself up.

06:11.120 --> 06:12.070
I'm not cold at all.

06:12.184 --> 06:13.672
I'm wearing the cloak you made for me.

06:13.870 --> 06:14.720
It's very warm.

06:14.920 --> 06:16.870
Look. My palms are even sweating.

06:20.830 --> 06:22.720
Come, sit down.

06:23.240 --> 06:23.950
Sit.

06:43.040 --> 06:45.000
Mother, are you stewing chicken?

06:47.070 --> 06:48.390
Our home isn't very big,

06:48.720 --> 06:50.600
so the kitchen is close by.

06:51.040 --> 06:52.000
Is the smell too...

06:52.000 --> 06:53.390
It smells wonderful.

06:54.040 --> 06:55.600
I clearly ate my fill this morning,

06:56.070 --> 06:56.870
but now

06:56.920 --> 06:58.088
the aroma of chicken soup

06:58.120 --> 06:59.880
and the sight
of these fried dough twists

06:59.976 --> 07:01.040
have made me hungry again.

07:02.000 --> 07:03.240
If you don't mind,

07:03.432 --> 07:05.064
I'd love a bowl of chicken soup

07:05.080 --> 07:06.200
with some fried dough twists.

07:07.480 --> 07:08.480
Wait here.

07:11.480 --> 07:14.070
You're young, so of course
you have a good appetite.

07:14.560 --> 07:16.390
You're family. Make yourself at home.

07:17.950 --> 07:19.000
Father is right.

07:19.750 --> 07:21.070
I am young.

07:24.480 --> 07:25.720
Father is right.

07:27.310 --> 07:28.680
You're still young.

07:32.070 --> 07:33.070
Here, Jinqi.

07:33.560 --> 07:34.360
Try some.

07:34.360 --> 07:34.920
Sure.

07:35.240 --> 07:36.120
Thank you, Mother.

07:46.216 --> 07:49.160
The soup is savory, and the fried
dough twists are fragrant. Delicious.

07:56.480 --> 07:58.800
They say one shouldn't talk
while eating or sleeping.

07:59.190 --> 08:00.480
I thought Young Master...

08:01.480 --> 08:03.560
I thought you weren't allowed

08:03.560 --> 08:04.800
to talk while eating.

08:05.160 --> 08:06.390
We're not that particular.

08:06.680 --> 08:07.830
Back in the military camp,

08:08.270 --> 08:10.360
we'd even eat while arguing.

08:21.160 --> 08:22.870
Mother, look.

08:23.480 --> 08:25.600
Lanxiang keeps staring at me
without saying a word.

08:26.070 --> 08:27.480
She must think I'm eating too much.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.840
I don't mind how much he eats.

08:35.000 --> 08:37.120
Watching him enjoy it

08:37.130 --> 08:38.990
just made me want
some fried dough twists, too.

08:39.440 --> 08:41.120
If you want some, just say so.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.840
It's not like I'd deprive you.

08:44.150 --> 08:44.790
Come.

08:48.120 --> 08:48.910
Here.

08:57.360 --> 08:59.600
Have you been busy with official duties?

09:00.480 --> 09:01.870
I've already completed the handover.

09:01.870 --> 09:02.870
I'm not busy at all.

09:07.030 --> 09:07.910
Father, Mother,

09:08.670 --> 09:10.790
there's something

09:10.790 --> 09:12.080
I need to tell you both.

09:13.120 --> 09:15.550
His Majesty has ordered me
to take up a post in the capital.

09:16.270 --> 09:17.360
It was all very sudden.

09:17.510 --> 09:18.670
I have to leave tomorrow.

09:19.840 --> 09:20.720
I want

09:22.360 --> 09:23.670
to take Lanxiang with me.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.080
I see.

09:27.192 --> 09:28.824
This is such an important matter.

09:29.390 --> 09:31.750
Why didn't you send
someone back to tell us?

09:32.120 --> 09:33.270
We could've prepared

09:33.600 --> 09:35.030
some things for you in advance.

09:36.080 --> 09:38.080
He's going. I'm not.

09:38.270 --> 09:39.630
That's why we didn't tell you.

09:40.630 --> 09:43.000
Lanxiang is mainly worried
about the two of you.

09:44.080 --> 09:45.150
But once I leave,

09:45.150 --> 09:47.256
I'm afraid I won't
be back for two or three years.

09:47.870 --> 09:51.144
I wouldn't feel at ease leaving
Lanxiang alone at the residence.

09:51.270 --> 09:52.720
So I can only ask

09:52.840 --> 09:55.048
that you let Lanxiang
come to the capital with me.

09:59.150 --> 10:00.840
Jinqi has a point.

10:01.390 --> 10:03.120
You've only just gotten married.

10:03.790 --> 10:06.030
You can't be apart for so long.

10:07.030 --> 10:08.720
Your mother and I are in good health.

10:08.730 --> 10:10.030
You don't need to worry about us.

10:10.550 --> 10:11.120
Yes.

10:11.670 --> 10:14.630
Now that Jinqi is going
to the capital to take up a post,

10:16.390 --> 10:18.870
you should go with him.

10:20.870 --> 10:22.790
I nearly died from illness
in the capital.

10:31.000 --> 10:32.000
I don't want to go.

10:42.030 --> 10:44.000
Lanxiang has been frail since childhood.

10:44.600 --> 10:45.510
In the capital,

10:45.912 --> 10:47.550
she nearly... nearly died from illness.

10:48.390 --> 10:49.270
It frightened her.

10:50.840 --> 10:52.030
How about this?

10:52.840 --> 10:53.270
You...

10:53.870 --> 10:55.120
You go on ahead.

10:55.550 --> 10:56.480
In a few days,

10:56.960 --> 10:58.670
when Lanxiang comes around,

10:59.000 --> 11:00.080
she can join you there.

11:00.600 --> 11:01.510
There'll still be time.

11:09.200 --> 11:10.790
Mother, the chicken soup has gone cold.

11:10.870 --> 11:12.150
I'll go get another hot bowl.

11:13.000 --> 11:13.870
Sit down.

11:13.870 --> 11:15.200
It's fine. I'll get it myself.

11:15.200 --> 11:15.960
Just sit down.

11:15.960 --> 11:16.750
No. You two...

11:16.750 --> 11:17.750
Give it to me. Come on.

11:18.320 --> 11:19.150
- Sit down.
- Sit.

11:19.150 --> 11:19.910
Thank you, Mother.

11:20.808 --> 11:21.620
Father, please sit.

11:21.630 --> 11:22.360
All right.

11:27.670 --> 11:29.270
Finest quality fabric!

11:30.150 --> 11:32.510
Sachets! Come take
a look at our sachets!

11:34.270 --> 11:36.120
Come take a look at our sachets!

11:36.120 --> 11:37.900
(Lu Family Painting
and Calligraphy Shop)

11:40.080 --> 11:41.910
Sachets!

11:42.360 --> 11:43.960
Take care!

11:44.968 --> 11:46.470
One book bag and one pencil case.

11:46.480 --> 11:47.270
Sure.

11:53.150 --> 11:54.320
Jiugao, come help.

11:54.750 --> 11:56.480
That'll be 1.6 coins.

11:57.870 --> 11:59.030
Jiugao, wrap these up.

12:03.360 --> 12:05.000
Why is business suddenly so good?

12:05.010 --> 12:07.064
Could it be because
His Majesty granted the marriage

12:07.112 --> 12:09.120
and they're here to see
what all the fuss is about?

12:10.270 --> 12:11.510
Who would spend real money

12:11.630 --> 12:13.360
just to see what all the fuss is about?

12:15.080 --> 12:15.670
Scholar Han

12:16.600 --> 12:17.600
lives next door.

12:19.200 --> 12:19.870
Now,

12:20.168 --> 12:23.000
word has spread that the pencil case
and book bag Scholar Han uses

12:23.150 --> 12:24.080
came from the shop.

12:24.280 --> 12:25.944
So people come
to share his good fortune,

12:25.992 --> 12:28.040
and that they'll pass
the examination next year too.

12:29.896 --> 12:32.120
So the top provincial graduate
actually lives next door.

12:33.360 --> 12:34.720
What a stroke of luck.

12:34.750 --> 12:35.720
There's no stopping it.

12:36.550 --> 12:37.080
Shopkeeper.

12:37.870 --> 12:38.750
How much is all this?

12:39.270 --> 12:40.150
Let me see.

12:40.550 --> 12:41.390
The books...

12:42.120 --> 12:42.630
and this.

12:43.200 --> 12:45.080
That'll be 7.1 coins altogether.

12:45.200 --> 12:45.670
All right.

12:47.200 --> 12:47.510
Here.

12:48.968 --> 12:50.000
Thank you for your business.

12:50.000 --> 12:50.550
Thank you.

12:51.200 --> 12:51.600
Take care.

12:52.480 --> 12:53.000
Take care.

13:08.750 --> 13:09.750
How many sachets?

13:12.390 --> 13:13.030
Three.

14:05.510 --> 14:06.440
What are you doing?

14:09.270 --> 14:10.960
If you put another bug on my head,

14:10.960 --> 14:12.520
I'm really going to hit you this time.

14:22.088 --> 14:23.390
I'm not a child anymore.

14:23.670 --> 14:25.120
Can you stop treating me like one?

14:30.630 --> 14:31.630
They're silk flowers.

14:47.544 --> 14:49.120
I saw them while I was out shopping.

14:49.720 --> 14:51.200
They said they were from the capital,

14:51.870 --> 14:53.360
so I bought two on a whim.

14:56.480 --> 14:58.550
This is clearly Jinling silk.

15:02.790 --> 15:04.150
You may have been fooled,

15:04.328 --> 15:05.656
but they still look nice.

15:08.270 --> 15:09.320
I'll keep one

15:09.550 --> 15:10.870
and give the other to Yinchen.

15:14.720 --> 15:16.440
These new items
need to be sorted, right?

15:40.104 --> 15:42.200
You've walked past here
three times already.

15:42.328 --> 15:43.960
This isn't a shop you should be eyeing.

15:44.200 --> 15:44.750
Let go of me!

15:46.080 --> 15:47.840
Please, let go of me!

15:55.670 --> 15:56.480
It's you?

16:00.630 --> 16:01.480
Zhi.

16:02.670 --> 16:03.790
It really is you.

16:08.120 --> 16:08.600
You...

16:31.120 --> 16:31.630
Father.

16:32.120 --> 16:33.030
For this visit,

16:33.240 --> 16:34.510
Lanxiang and I also prepared

16:34.510 --> 16:35.480
a gift for Mister Lu.

16:36.120 --> 16:38.000
I'd like to pay him a visit, too.

16:38.960 --> 16:39.790
I'll take you there.

16:43.120 --> 16:43.720
All right.

16:49.670 --> 16:51.550
Don't be afraid, child.

16:52.200 --> 16:53.000
Don't be afraid.

16:53.550 --> 16:54.910
Didn't you go home?

16:56.870 --> 16:58.240
How did you end up like this?

16:59.150 --> 17:00.440
What happened?

17:02.910 --> 17:03.960
Say something.

17:05.590 --> 17:06.240
Mother,

17:06.856 --> 17:08.310
go get her a bowl of chicken soup.

17:08.790 --> 17:10.830
I'll take Zhi inside
for some food first.

17:11.310 --> 17:12.750
Once she's feeling better,

17:12.880 --> 17:14.000
we can catch up slowly.

17:47.510 --> 17:49.480
Let's go inside. Come.

18:16.400 --> 18:17.070
Sit down.

18:32.880 --> 18:33.920
Here's the chicken soup.

18:36.110 --> 18:37.350
Eat something first.

18:38.030 --> 18:39.000
Have it while it's hot.

18:40.440 --> 18:41.640
I'll heat some water.

18:41.640 --> 18:42.680
You can wash up later.

18:53.384 --> 18:54.830
You've been hungry for so long.

18:54.920 --> 18:57.030
Have something soft first
to warm your stomach.

18:59.400 --> 19:00.510
Once you're feeling better,

19:00.720 --> 19:01.830
I'll give you some meat.

19:10.720 --> 19:12.720
My parents thought I was a disgrace.

19:28.590 --> 19:29.440
They said

19:30.880 --> 19:32.310
I never should've gone back.

19:34.030 --> 19:35.590
I should've died out there.

19:39.920 --> 19:41.960
They sold me to a cripple

19:43.160 --> 19:44.830
in exchange for a calf.

19:48.160 --> 19:49.680
I couldn't endure the abuse,

19:51.160 --> 19:52.350
so I ran away.

19:55.070 --> 19:55.960
But

19:57.960 --> 20:00.070
I don't seem to know where else to go.

20:04.590 --> 20:06.270
I kept walking

20:10.310 --> 20:11.720
and walking

20:13.880 --> 20:16.030
until my shoes wore through,

20:17.880 --> 20:19.590
but I still didn't know where to go.

20:32.270 --> 20:33.000
Eat.

20:34.248 --> 20:36.510
Once you've had your fill
and regained your strength,

20:36.632 --> 20:38.120
we'll look for somewhere together.

20:39.070 --> 20:40.240
The world is so vast.

20:40.750 --> 20:41.680
We'll find you a place

20:41.880 --> 20:43.480
one way or another.

20:57.830 --> 20:58.790
Drink up.

21:42.270 --> 21:43.960
Are you still looking for Ji'er?

21:48.720 --> 21:51.350
Mister Lu and Furong are helping, too,

21:52.310 --> 21:53.680
but there's been no news.

21:56.030 --> 21:56.720
Still,

21:57.480 --> 21:59.510
performers travel far
and wide with their shows.

22:00.000 --> 22:01.720
We'll hear something eventually.

22:03.830 --> 22:05.160
I know where Ji'er is.

22:12.550 --> 22:13.680
On my way here,

22:14.640 --> 22:16.960
I saw that branded mule.

22:18.000 --> 22:20.030
So while I was begging for leftovers,

22:20.480 --> 22:22.240
I went closer and listened carefully.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.510
What did you hear?

22:26.640 --> 22:28.750
They do business in the capital.

22:29.790 --> 22:30.960
Ji'er is in the capital.

22:35.160 --> 22:37.110
Will you go
to the capital to find Ji'er?

22:37.960 --> 22:38.720
Of course.

22:39.816 --> 22:42.088
I'll leave for the capital
first thing tomorrow morning.

22:43.640 --> 22:44.720
Tomorrow morning?

22:51.830 --> 22:52.400
Here.

22:52.640 --> 22:55.240
My son-in-law is going
to the capital to take up his post.

22:55.784 --> 22:57.592
It's been decided
that he'll leave tomorrow.

22:57.680 --> 22:59.590
Lanxiang didn't want to go at first,

23:00.000 --> 23:01.000
but now it seems

23:02.110 --> 23:03.680
she has no choice but to go.

23:04.640 --> 23:05.830
Come in and test the water.

23:07.070 --> 23:07.960
You have chilblains,

23:08.160 --> 23:09.880
so I didn't make the water too hot.

23:10.350 --> 23:11.160
Take it slowly.

23:17.580 --> 23:22.500
♪Whose voice is still singing?♪

23:23.240 --> 23:24.030
Is this all right?

23:24.030 --> 23:28.140
♪A faint melody
drifts through my dreams♪

23:28.860 --> 23:33.500
♪A cold soul crosses the river,
gazing toward the loyal family afar♪

23:33.500 --> 23:36.700
♪As if destined by fate♪

23:36.700 --> 23:40.440
♪To reunite, then wander once more♪

23:40.440 --> 23:41.110
Zhi.

23:41.448 --> 23:43.440
Tomorrow, we'll go
to the capital together.

23:44.000 --> 23:45.160
We'll find Ji'er together.

23:47.310 --> 23:48.070
All right.

23:48.070 --> 23:51.660
♪Promises are like candlelight,
flickering in the wind♪

23:51.980 --> 23:54.380
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

23:54.380 --> 23:58.140
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

23:58.140 --> 24:00.860
♪The past falls like withered leaves♪

24:00.860 --> 24:05.300
♪Scattered into the dust♪

24:07.480 --> 24:08.240
Young Master.

24:08.648 --> 24:11.400
These are sachets from the Lu Family
Painting and Calligraphy Shop,

24:11.400 --> 24:12.880
along with pencil cases and book bags.

24:14.728 --> 24:16.000
Why are you giving me these?

24:16.790 --> 24:18.200
This year's top provincial graduate

24:18.240 --> 24:19.720
lives next door to the shop.

24:19.790 --> 24:21.560
Many scholars
have gone there to buy them,

24:21.608 --> 24:23.400
saying they'll share in his good fortune

24:23.440 --> 24:24.830
and pass the examination next year.

24:25.200 --> 24:26.270
I was thinking

24:26.270 --> 24:28.240
you could send these to Pengjian Study

24:28.240 --> 24:29.440
in Young Madam's name.

24:30.270 --> 24:32.640
Third Young Master and
Fourth Young Master are studying now,

24:32.640 --> 24:34.424
so they might share
in his good fortune, too.

24:34.790 --> 24:36.550
If they pass the examination one day,

24:38.200 --> 24:40.550
Second Madam may remember
Young Madam's kindness.

24:42.000 --> 24:43.110
The top provincial graduate?

24:45.000 --> 24:46.110
Scholar Han?

24:51.480 --> 24:52.830
What did I do wrong?

24:53.272 --> 24:54.640
Please tell me, Young Master.

24:57.590 --> 25:00.110
You certainly know how to win
people over for Young Madam.

25:02.960 --> 25:05.000
You're leaving for the capital tomorrow.

25:05.256 --> 25:07.016
Young Madam will
be alone at the residence

25:07.048 --> 25:08.200
with no one to rely on.

25:08.440 --> 25:10.400
Naturally, it's best
to win over whoever you can.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.510
Since you're so devoted to her,

25:22.400 --> 25:23.880
take these to Aunt Lingxiao.

25:24.350 --> 25:25.030
Tell her

25:25.920 --> 25:27.160
Young Madam and I

25:27.270 --> 25:28.888
are giving them to Jinqiao and Jincen.

25:29.880 --> 25:30.880
Mention you, too?

25:34.510 --> 25:35.030
Yes.

26:02.750 --> 26:03.880
You can go if you want.

26:04.270 --> 26:05.830
I'm not going to the capital anyway.

26:06.880 --> 26:07.920
You should go on your own.

26:08.270 --> 26:09.440
I'll stay in Jinling

26:09.880 --> 26:11.750
and fulfill your filial duties
in your stead.

26:11.960 --> 26:12.790
I'm not going.

26:12.856 --> 26:13.720
I don't want to go.

26:34.104 --> 26:35.750
I'm leaving for the capital tomorrow.

26:36.808 --> 26:38.776
Knowing we won't see
each other for a long time,

26:40.072 --> 26:41.720
I can't help feeling a little down.

26:45.288 --> 26:47.000
Would you mind having a drink with me?

27:04.920 --> 27:05.830
Actually,

27:07.640 --> 27:09.000
the capital is quite nice.

27:10.040 --> 27:11.672
It's right under the Emperor's watch,

27:11.704 --> 27:13.576
and blessed
with outstanding people and places.

27:13.928 --> 27:14.960
No matter how nice it is,

27:16.240 --> 27:17.350
you still don't like it.

27:27.480 --> 27:28.200
People

27:28.720 --> 27:30.440
can change their minds

27:31.400 --> 27:32.640
over time.

27:33.240 --> 27:34.680
If you don't like it, so be it.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.070
I don't want to force you.

27:39.832 --> 27:42.040
Now that the transfer order
has been issued,

27:42.376 --> 27:44.632
I have no choice
but to report for duty in the capital.

27:45.790 --> 27:46.880
But I promise you

27:47.160 --> 27:49.160
I'll petition His Majesty
as soon as possible

27:49.304 --> 27:50.696
to transfer me back to Jinling.

27:52.920 --> 27:53.960
I'll drink first.

28:19.110 --> 28:21.880
This rice liquor
tastes a little strange.

28:28.880 --> 28:29.750
Actually,

28:31.270 --> 28:32.720
what I wanted to tell you is...

28:51.240 --> 28:52.720
Lin Jinqi, you...

28:54.750 --> 28:56.200
drugged me.

29:13.460 --> 29:16.060
♪Look at us♪

29:16.940 --> 29:21.020
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

29:22.400 --> 29:23.200
From now on,

29:24.030 --> 29:26.070
you must never drink
carelessly when you're out.

29:30.030 --> 29:31.200
I did promise you

29:31.336 --> 29:33.640
I'd get transferred back
to Jinling as soon as possible.

29:34.510 --> 29:35.590
But I never promised

29:36.830 --> 29:38.200
to leave you behind in Jinling.

29:38.200 --> 29:40.220
♪However deep the joy or sorrow♪

29:41.100 --> 29:43.740
♪There will always
be someone to share it with♪

29:43.740 --> 29:46.620
♪Our bond runs deep♪

29:48.000 --> 29:48.790
Lanxiang.

29:50.550 --> 29:52.000
Now that you've married me,

29:53.880 --> 29:55.510
stop thinking about Han Liang.

29:58.110 --> 29:59.350
The past cannot be undone,

30:00.344 --> 30:02.024
but the future is still ours to shape.

30:04.680 --> 30:06.590
Whether he's Provincial Examination
Top Scholar Han

30:07.680 --> 30:08.750
or Top Imperial Scholar Han,

30:11.480 --> 30:12.680
he has nothing to do with us.

30:14.880 --> 30:17.720
Young Master, Old Master sent word

30:17.880 --> 30:19.240
that he wishes to see you.

30:19.272 --> 30:21.416
He's already waiting
for you in the ancestral hall.

31:01.400 --> 31:01.880
Grandfather.

31:46.960 --> 31:47.550
Grandfather,

31:49.070 --> 31:50.590
you summoned me here.

31:50.888 --> 31:52.264
What guidance do you have for me?

31:54.960 --> 31:56.160
Do you know

31:57.350 --> 31:59.880
I'm not pleased
that you're going to the capital?

32:03.030 --> 32:04.350
I had some sense of that.

32:05.200 --> 32:06.030
I just don't know

32:06.830 --> 32:07.880
the reason behind it.

32:10.920 --> 32:12.590
This move to the capital

32:13.510 --> 32:17.030
may seem like a promotion
that brings honor to our family,

32:18.200 --> 32:22.200
but fortune often conceals misfortune.

32:26.640 --> 32:28.000
I'm afraid that one day,

32:28.830 --> 32:31.830
the destruction of the Lin family

32:33.640 --> 32:35.440
may begin with you.

32:39.440 --> 32:40.590
Though I may be unworthy,

32:41.000 --> 32:43.270
I've always kept your teachings
and my mentor's in mind.

32:43.960 --> 32:46.160
I've never done
anything to disgrace our family.

32:47.912 --> 32:49.590
Why would you say that, Grandfather?

32:50.790 --> 32:54.200
The sages taught the Three Bonds
and Five Constant Virtues.

32:55.750 --> 32:56.790
Have you lived by them?

33:03.288 --> 33:04.680
Marrying without telling you

33:05.270 --> 33:06.480
was indeed my fault.

33:08.160 --> 33:08.590
But...

33:11.096 --> 33:12.310
I did inform His Majesty.

33:17.310 --> 33:18.510
The father guides the son.

33:19.350 --> 33:21.680
Today, when your father
goes against your wishes,

33:21.680 --> 33:24.440
you dare use
the sovereign's authority against him.

33:25.270 --> 33:26.750
The sovereign guides his subjects.

33:27.240 --> 33:29.960
If one day the sovereign
goes against your wishes,

33:30.160 --> 33:33.240
what will you dare use against him then?

33:38.920 --> 33:40.740
Grandfather,
that's too grave an accusation.

33:40.750 --> 33:41.830
I would never do that,

33:42.440 --> 33:43.160
nor would I dare.

33:49.880 --> 33:51.510
Observe what a man does.

33:52.480 --> 33:54.240
Consider why he does it.

33:55.110 --> 33:57.440
See where his heart finds peace.

33:59.310 --> 34:01.240
How can he hide his true self?

34:03.070 --> 34:05.880
Can you swear before our ancestors

34:05.880 --> 34:10.360
that you've never deceived
His Majesty or defied his authority?

34:13.230 --> 34:15.400
What exactly did this man do

34:16.710 --> 34:19.960
that forced him to leave his homeland
and seek refuge overseas?

34:20.000 --> 34:21.840
His clan was fighting
over the family estate.

34:21.960 --> 34:23.320
After his father lost the dispute,

34:23.384 --> 34:24.760
he disappeared without a trace.

34:24.952 --> 34:26.550
He no longer wanted to fight over it,

34:27.280 --> 34:29.230
but his relatives didn't believe him.

34:29.304 --> 34:31.096
They were determined to eliminate him.

34:31.480 --> 34:33.030
(Afraid of implicating anyone else,)

34:33.096 --> 34:34.760
(he had no choice but to flee far away.)

34:43.670 --> 34:44.400
Grandfather.

34:48.190 --> 34:48.800
I...

35:01.920 --> 35:03.440
I don't want to know

35:03.710 --> 35:05.150
what you've done,

35:06.400 --> 35:08.670
and I hope I never

35:09.710 --> 35:10.800
have to know.

35:18.070 --> 35:21.070
Serving the Emperor
is like living beside a tiger.

35:22.510 --> 35:23.550
I agreed to let

35:23.710 --> 35:25.550
Jinlan, Jinqiao, and Xiuwan

35:25.840 --> 35:27.320
go to the capital

35:27.800 --> 35:28.550
with you

35:29.110 --> 35:33.440
because I want you
to think of your siblings

35:33.440 --> 35:34.760
before you act

35:36.230 --> 35:39.190
and exercise some restraint.

36:01.670 --> 36:03.230
They all deserve

36:04.150 --> 36:06.280
to live well.

36:14.400 --> 36:15.550
To live.

36:16.230 --> 36:18.590
To live well.

36:43.760 --> 36:44.400
Grandfather.

36:44.550 --> 36:46.150
You agreed to let Jinlan come with us?

36:46.510 --> 36:47.510
Jinqi, that's wonderful!

36:48.344 --> 36:50.248
Thank you
for granting my wish, Grandfather.

36:51.710 --> 36:53.880
Did I pass your test, Jinqi?

36:54.840 --> 36:55.670
You did.

36:56.150 --> 36:57.510
Rest and recover, Jinqi.

36:57.510 --> 36:58.960
I'll study hard.

36:59.272 --> 37:00.400
I'll go make funny faces

37:00.920 --> 37:03.110
for Aunt Shunhua.

37:03.510 --> 37:05.760
Old Madam always laughs
when I make funny faces.

37:59.030 --> 38:00.510
You're awake, my lady.

38:07.760 --> 38:08.630
I'm on the ship?

38:11.840 --> 38:12.630
We've already

38:12.800 --> 38:15.000
been away from Longjiang Pass Wharf
for over four hours.

38:18.710 --> 38:19.550
Where's Zhi?

38:20.920 --> 38:22.030
The person you brought back

38:22.360 --> 38:24.000
was naturally brought aboard with us.

38:30.840 --> 38:31.800
Didn't she say anything?

38:34.480 --> 38:34.960
Say what?

38:51.760 --> 38:52.320
My lady.

38:53.440 --> 38:54.440
Are you still dizzy?

38:54.960 --> 38:56.190
Do you feel unwell anywhere?

39:07.110 --> 39:07.670
My lady.

39:08.590 --> 39:09.550
I was wrong.

39:10.190 --> 39:11.190
It was my fault.

39:11.920 --> 39:13.710
It took me so long to finally marry you.

39:14.550 --> 39:16.920
I truly couldn't bear to be apart
from you for even one day.

39:21.190 --> 39:22.190
I promise you

39:22.248 --> 39:24.110
I'll petition His Majesty
as soon as possible

39:24.190 --> 39:25.480
to transfer me back to Jinling.

39:28.070 --> 39:28.880
My lady.

39:30.000 --> 39:31.030
I know

39:31.230 --> 39:33.320
what I did this time
was far too reckless.

39:33.592 --> 39:35.140
I'll accept any punishment you give me.

39:35.160 --> 39:36.648
As long as it helps you calm down.

39:49.840 --> 39:51.150
If you're angry,

39:51.230 --> 39:52.320
just let it out.

39:52.920 --> 39:54.440
Hit me or scold me.

39:55.760 --> 39:57.710
Don't keep it bottled up inside.

39:58.230 --> 39:59.630
It's not good for your health.

40:07.400 --> 40:09.550
You actually drugged me
with a knockout drug.

40:10.590 --> 40:12.960
Even a play wouldn't dare make up
something this outrageous.

40:13.360 --> 40:15.440
Even if I wrote it,
no one would believe it.

40:15.710 --> 40:16.880
It wasn't a knockout drug.

40:19.880 --> 40:21.760
Well, it wasn't a knockout drug.

40:21.960 --> 40:25.150
I got a physician to prescribe
something to help you sleep.

40:26.190 --> 40:27.190
It won't harm you.

40:33.360 --> 40:35.110
But I clearly saw you drink it, too.

40:38.840 --> 40:39.920
I pretended.

40:40.670 --> 40:42.800
It looked like I drank it, but actually

40:43.960 --> 40:45.840
I poured it onto the

40:46.710 --> 40:47.800
handkerchief in my sleeve.

40:52.030 --> 40:54.760
Now that would make
a good scene in a play.

41:02.360 --> 41:05.550
So are you angry or not?

41:07.280 --> 41:08.110
Guess.

41:10.400 --> 41:11.510
Then you've forgiven me?

41:12.360 --> 41:14.710
I'll reserve judgment
and see how you behave.

41:18.880 --> 41:19.590
How I behave?

41:24.840 --> 41:26.880
Look at that miserable face of yours.

41:27.360 --> 41:28.670
Let me teach you a few tricks.

41:29.550 --> 41:32.360
You've got to be completely shameless.

41:32.550 --> 41:35.710
Then things will work out for you.

41:36.230 --> 41:38.110
Stop giving me bad advice.

41:38.840 --> 41:40.480
I've got five children already.

41:40.840 --> 41:42.110
You know about fighting.

41:42.800 --> 41:43.630
But women?

41:44.440 --> 41:45.360
That's my specialty.

41:46.510 --> 41:48.880
Persistence always wins a woman over.

41:49.360 --> 41:51.280
The ship is only so big.

41:52.110 --> 41:53.800
You're bound

41:54.280 --> 41:56.320
to keep running into each other.

41:56.880 --> 41:59.280
Get seasick, and she might
fall right into your arms.

41:59.560 --> 42:02.000
And when you bathe,
you'll have to undress, won't you?

42:03.920 --> 42:05.510
(Your wife is young.)

42:05.960 --> 42:07.000
(I guarantee)

42:07.320 --> 42:10.030
(she'll get all flustered
and start blushing.)

42:38.030 --> 42:40.000
I... undress.

42:56.728 --> 42:57.800
I want to take a bath.

43:05.260 --> 43:07.580
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.150 --> 43:10.000
Open your eyes and take a good look!

43:10.020 --> 43:11.860
It's your man
who's been pestering me all day.

43:11.880 --> 43:14.470
You can't control your own man,
so you take your anger out on me.

43:14.488 --> 43:16.150
If you've got the nerve,
go hit your man.

43:16.360 --> 43:17.230
Go on, hit him!

43:17.920 --> 43:19.320
Why are they fighting again?

43:28.030 --> 43:28.590
You...

43:51.741 --> 43:55.861
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:58.701 --> 44:03.221
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:04.501 --> 44:08.421
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:09.101 --> 44:11.861
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:12.581 --> 44:14.901
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:14.901 --> 44:17.981
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:19.501 --> 44:23.741
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:26.661 --> 44:30.821
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:32.621 --> 44:36.181
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:36.181 --> 44:39.741
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:40.541 --> 44:46.221
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:46.581 --> 44:50.901
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:51.261 --> 44:54.221
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:54.221 --> 44:57.981
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:57.981 --> 45:00.861
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:00.861 --> 45:04.941
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:04.941 --> 45:08.301
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:08.301 --> 45:12.061
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:12.061 --> 45:16.061
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:16.821 --> 45:20.981
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:20.981 --> 45:24.421
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:24.421 --> 45:28.061
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:28.061 --> 45:30.941
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:30.941 --> 45:35.021
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:35.021 --> 45:38.381
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:38.381 --> 45:42.021
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:42.021 --> 45:49.821
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
